          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Design interfaces</strong>
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Document architecture</strong>
    </li>
  </Steps>

  <hr />

  <h2>🎮 Code Playground</h2>

  <iframe
    src="https://stackblitz.com/edit/Poom5741-ai-sdlc-quests?embed=1&file=block-5-architecture/quest-14-full-system/index.js&view=editor"
    style="width:100%;height:500px;border:0;border-radius:4px;"
    allow="cross-origin-isolation"
    title="Quest 5.2: Full System Design"
  />

  <hr />

  <h2>✅ Verification</h2>

  <pre><code class="language-bash">{`node test.js`}</code></pre>

  <hr />

  <h2>📐 Architecture Patterns</h2>

  <h3>RAG System</h3>
  <pre><code>{`Documents → Embeddings → Vector Store → LLM → Answer`}</code></pre>

  <h3>Multi-Agent System</h3>
  <pre><code>{`Planner → Coder → Reviewer → Tester`}</code></pre>

  <h3>Event-Driven</h3>
  <pre><code>{`Event → Handler → Side Effects`}</code></pre>
